<title>UK: UK underwrites loans for LNG development in Quatar.</title>
<headline>UK underwrites loans for LNG development in Quatar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Export Creditis Guarantee Department said on Friday that it was underwriting $45 million of loans as part of a financing package to develop a major liquefied natural gas export production facility in Qatar.</p>
<p>The loans will be used to reimburse Qatar-based borrowers for payments made to a substantial number of British contractors which have provided goods and servies for the upstream stage of the project to explot the Khuff offshore natrual gas reservoir.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
</text>
